"history.main.edgegift.title" = "The edge";
"history.main.edgegift.body" = "The stamp edge was left for old Fedya. He says the mail underneath always went sour. They used to bring the bag from the Saddle by boat, until the boat was put on trestles.";
"history.main.taggift.title" = "The stamp";
"history.main.taggift.body" = "The stamped chip was left for Vera. She answers shortly: the lower stamp, noted.";
"history.main.cardgift.title" = "The card";
"history.main.cardgift.body" = "Somov's card was left in a box still ahead. Pimen: he buried Ferapont in August, the apples were not picked. Nina: Ferapont has been gone since August, the apple trees were standing, she used to bring him a jar.";
"history.main.polegift.title" = "Someone else's pole";
"history.main.polegift.body" = "The pole with no nicks was left for Kuzma. He says it is not his. So someone further down is measuring too.";
"history.main.graphgift.title" = "Pilot";
"history.main.graphgift.body" = "The scrap of graph paper was left for Mitya. He writes: pilot, like his own at 7.3, only the hand is not his. Someone had already measured.";
"history.main.passgift.title" = "The pass";
"history.main.passgift.body" = "The pass was left for old Fedya. He knows the shop, not the person: the lower yard, an old pattern of pass. He has not gone there since autumn.";
